# drive v1: mctas mobfarm siding-bench <design> --wired --launch --from 1 --to 1 --nights 1 --placed-in-order --drive-out F (arrivals launched from rest on the bench's launcher; the release placed as a block: the loop's input)
# caption carts launched in and released by the test bench; the siding's own redstone does the rest
# seed 1
# days 2
# walk random
# ai on
# start Run::start(spec with no blocks, RunOpts { ai: true, ..RunOpts::steady(seed, days * 24000, WalkMode::Random) }), the build (the `build:` line), then the design's entity lines spawned in order (eN: line N from 0, eN.pK: its passenger K from 0); t0 = the world's time then
# act t: applied when the world's time is the build's start + t, before the run's next tick (the bench's own order)
# t0 13700
# build: built in order instead: Run::start with the design's blocks and block entities removed (no settle), then each `act t set x y z <state>` a placement with the game's updates (flags 3) and each `act t nbt x y z <snbt>` a container's fill, in the build order (mobfarm::placing::build_steps_of: ironfarm's build_order_of, each lit portal's cells at one tick after every other block, fluid sources poured last, then the design's listed steps (`build: last -5,-2,-7 -15,-4,-5 -14,-4,-5 -13,-4,-5 -12,-4,-5 -11,-4,-5 -10,-4,-5 -9,-4,-5 -8,-4,-5 -7,-4,-5 -6,-4,-5 -5,-4,-5 -4,-4,-5 -3,-4,-5 -2,-4,-5 -1,-4,-5 0,-4,-5 1,-4,-5 2,-4,-5 3,-4,-5 4,-4,-5 5,-4,-5 6,-4,-5 0,-1,-6 3,-1,-8 -6,-1,-8 0,0,-2 1,-2,-1 -12,-1,-12 -5,-2,2 -7,-2,-1 2,-1,6 4,1,-2 -6,-3,-1 1,-2,6 3,-2,-7 -15,-2,-10`: fills-last, each container's contents a step of its own after every placement and no comparator output merged; last, these cells at the very end)), each cell's priced gap between placements (20 gt; 40 gt at a cell the bill charges place:edge); every time here counts from the build's start (time 0), not from t0.
# spawn 13700
# expect t: the event happened in the tick that brought the world's time to t0 + t (an act at t comes before the tick to t0 + t + 1)
